<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f4f4f7; padding: 24px;">
    <div style="max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 32px;">
      <h2 style="color: #1a1a2e; margin-top: 0;">Maqolalar</h2>
      <p style="color: #444; font-size: 15px;">Assalomu alaykum!</p>
      <p style="color: #444; font-size: 15px;">
        Parolingizni tiklash uchun quyidagi kodni kiriting:
      </p>
      <div style="text-align: center; margin: 24px 0;">
        <span style="display: inline-block; font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 8px; color: #1a1a2e; background: #f0f0f5; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 8px;">
          {{code}}
        </span>
      </div>
      <p style="color: #888; font-size: 13px;">
        Kod 3 daqiqa davomida amal qiladi. Agar siz parol tiklashni so'ramagan bo'lsangiz, bu xatni e'tiborsiz qoldiring — hisobingiz xavfsiz.
      </p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
